/**
 * The aggiovato lockup (src/assets/brand/lockup-dark.svg): the mark and the wordmark as one drawing,
 * so the name is part of the logo, not selectable text. Decorative: the link around it carries the
 * accessible name. Colours from tokens: body lavender, accent peach, word in the text colour.
 */
